{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>יֶאֱהָבַנִי.</b> With a patach in the bet, like \"פֶּן תִדְבָּקָנִי הָרָעָה\" (Genesis 19:19)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra refers to the phenomenon of patach ganuv (furtive patach) before a guttural; he cites the parallel grammatical structure in the suffixed form with a het-based verb."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:17.428527500Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}